   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## ltxv-i2v.json\n\nPrompt-driven animation of our character (no driving clip)\n\n**Does:** a still + a **descriptive prompt** -> a clip of the character performing it (`LTXVImgToVideo`, Lightricks LTX-Video v1). The VAE rides inside the checkpoint (`CheckpointLoaderSimple`); text comes from `t5xxl_fp8` with CLIP type `ltxv`. LTX wants **long descriptive prompts** (upstream's own warning - a short prompt visibly degrades it) and canvases in multiples of 32 with 8n+1 frames.\n**Measured (E22, 2026-10-15):** 13B-distilled-fp8 (ships): 97 frames at 768x768 in **35 s** cold / 5 s warm, **17.3 GB** peak; identity holds and the spell stays palm-scale. 2B-distilled-fp8: 15 s but identity slips and the spell overgrows (the quick-test arm). Shared config: bundled VAE, t5xxl_fp8 with CLIP type `ltxv`, 8 steps, no STG, cfg 1.\n**Knobs:** the **prompt** (elaborate, motion-first); the **checkpoint** (13B-distilled-fp8 ships - 35 s cold; 2B-distilled-fp8 is the 15-s quick-test arm, same graph via `--set`); **steps** on `LTXVScheduler` (8 ships for distilled); canvas/frames (32 / 8n+1).\n**Traps:** distilled runs with NO STG and cfg 1 (vendor multi-scale recipe); fps is 25 (`LTXVConditioning.frame_rate` + `CreateVideo`). This is v1, not v2 - v2 is 19B and does not fit this card.\n**Siblings:** `wan-vace-reference.json` (S28) is the other prompt-driven route (14B, 45 min); this one is the fast arm.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S35** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E22** in `video/EXPERIMENTS.md`.*"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## ltxv-i2v.json\n\nPrompt-driven animation of our character (no driving clip)\n\n**Does:** a still + a **descriptive prompt** -> a clip of the character performing it (`LTXVImgToVideo`, Lightricks LTX-Video v1). The VAE rides inside the checkpoint (`CheckpointLoaderSimple`); text comes from `t5xxl_fp8` with CLIP type `ltxv`. LTX wants **long descriptive prompts** (upstream's own warning - a short prompt visibly degrades it) and canvases in multiples of 32 with 8n+1 frames.\n**Measured (E22, 2026-10-15):** 13B-distilled-fp8 (ships): 97 frames at 768x768 in **35 s** cold / 5 s warm, **17.3 GB** peak; identity holds and the spell stays palm-scale. 2B-distilled-fp8: 15 s but identity slips and the spell overgrows (the quick-test arm). Shared config: bundled VAE, t5xxl_fp8 with CLIP type `ltxv`, 8 steps, no STG, cfg 1.\n**Knobs:** the **prompt** (elaborate, motion-first); the **checkpoint** (13B-distilled-fp8 ships - 35 s cold; 2B-distilled-fp8 is the 15-s quick-test arm, same graph via `--set`); **steps** on `LTXVScheduler` (8 ships for distilled); canvas/frames (32 / 8n+1).\n**Traps:** distilled runs with NO STG and cfg 1 (vendor multi-scale recipe); fps is 25 (`LTXVConditioning.frame_rate` + `CreateVideo`). This is v1, not v2 - v2 is 19B and does not fit this card.\n**Siblings:** `wan-vace-reference.json` (S28) is the other prompt-driven route (14B, 45 min); this one is the fast arm.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S35** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E22** in `video/EXPERIMENTS.md`.*"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
